Feature: Advice in the app
  Beside your commander, an [[advisor]] looks at the map of your team in its own time. By default
  it is the lookahead. When it sees a better move, it sends a [[proposal]]. The ADVISOR panel, at
  the top left of the battlefield, lists each proposal that is good now. A line gives the
  reason, and the time that is left before the proposal is stale. The line with the most points
  is the first.

  The advisor does not give orders. You decide. To take a proposal, click its line, or press Y
  to take the first one. The drone gets the order and the [[queue]] of the proposal, and the
  line leaves the panel. If you do not take a proposal, it goes when its time is over. The
  advisor can be slow, so a proposal can be some seconds old when it arrives.

  The warnings of [[The advisor]] stay as they are. They appear as one line each, in amber. The
  proposals are green.

  Expectation: The ADVISOR panel is empty when the advisor has no proposal
    When the commander joins the game
    Then the proposal in the ADVISOR panel is none

  Expectation: The ADVISOR panel lists a proposal with its drone, its order and its points
    Given the proposal in the ADVISOR panel is the west tower for the first Blue drone, 6 points
    Then the proposal in the ADVISOR panel is the west tower for the first Blue drone, 6 points

  Expectation: A click on a proposal gives its order
    Given the proposal in the ADVISOR panel is the west tower for the first Blue drone, 6 points
    When the commander clicks the proposal
    Then the order of the first Blue drone is take the west tower
    And the proposal in the ADVISOR panel is none

  Expectation: The accept key gives the order of the first proposal
    Given the proposal in the ADVISOR panel is the west tower for the first Blue drone, 6 points
    When the commander presses the accept key
    Then the order of the first Blue drone is take the west tower
    And the proposal in the ADVISOR panel is none

  Expectation: A proposal that is stale leaves the panel
    The proposal is good for 3 seconds. Nobody takes it.

    Given the proposal in the ADVISOR panel is the west tower for the first Blue drone, 6 points, good for 3 seconds
    When the time of the proposal is over
    Then the proposal in the ADVISOR panel is none
